        "textDefaultValues": [
            {
                "fieldname": "pmTitle",
                "text": "<tal:vars define=\"applicants_signaletic python: self.getApplicantsSignaletic(); portion_outs_text python: self.getPortionOutsText(); work_location_signaletic python: self.getWorkLocationSignaletic(); licence_subject python: self.getLicenceSubject(); reference self/reference\"> URBANISME - <tal:a replace=\"self/reference\"/> - <tal:a replace=\"applicants_signaletic\"/> - <tal:a replace=\"licence_subject\"/>, <tal:a replace=\"work_location_signaletic\"/>, cadastr\u00e9 <tal:a replace=\"portion_outs_text\"/> - SAISINE - Information </tal:vars>"
            },
            {
                "fieldname": "pmDescription",
                "text": "<p> saisine du Fonctionnaire d\u00e9l\u00e9gu\u00e9 pour absence de notification de la d\u00e9cision dans le d\u00e9lai imparti</p>"
            },
            {
                "fieldname": "pmMotivation",
                "text": "<tal:vars define=\"\r\n    licence_helper python: self;\r\n    si_1dem python: applicantobj.voc_term('personTitle').getMultiplicity() == 'single';\r\n    si_demandeurs python: applicantobj.voc_term('personTitle').getMultiplicity() == 'plural';\r\n    applicantobj python: self.getApplicants() and self.getApplicants()[0];\r\n    applicants_signaletic python: self.getApplicantsSignaletic(); \r\n    work_location_signaletic python: self.getWorkLocationSignaletic(); \r\n    portion_outs_text python: self.getPortionOutsText(); \r\n    licence_subject python: self.getLicenceSubject();\r\n    \r\n\r\n    lastMissingPart python: self.getLastMissingPart();\r\n    lastMissingPartDeposit python: self.getLastMissingPartDeposit();\r\n    lastAcknowledgment python: self.getLastAcknowledgment();\r\n    lastDefaultAcknowledgment python: self.getLastDefaultAcknowledgment();\r\n    date_incomplet python: lastMissingPart and licence_view.format_date(lastMissingPart.getEventDate());\r\n    date_complement python: lastMissingPartDeposit and licence_view.format_date(lastMissingPartDeposit.getEventDate());\r\n    accuse_de_reception_complet python: self.getLastAcknowledgment(); \r\n    date_accuse_de_reception python: licence.getLastAcknowledgment() and tool.formatDate(licence.getLastAcknowledgment().getEventDate());\r\n     \r\n  si_CU2 python: self.get_related_licences(licence_types=['CODT_UrbanCertificateTwo'], decision_limit_date=(self.add_years(self.today(), -2)), with_historic=True);\r\n    si_PU python:[self.get_related_licences(licence_types=['BuildLicence', 'CODT_BuildLicence'], decision_limit_date='1907/01/02', with_historic=True)] if hasattr(self, 'get_related_licences') else [];\r\n    si_DC3 python:[self.get_related_licences(licence_types=['Declaration'], with_historic=True)] if hasattr(self, 'get_related_licences') else [];\r\n\r\n    related_licences_accepted python:[self.get_related_licences(licence_types=['BuildLicence', 'CODT_BuildLicence'], decision_limit_date='1907/01/02', licence_state='accepted', with_historic=True)] if hasattr(self, 'get_related_licences') else [];\r\n    related_licences_refused python:[self.get_related_licences(licence_types=['BuildLicence', 'CODT_BuildLicence'], decision_limit_date='1907/01/02', licence_state='refused', with_historic=True)] if hasattr(self, 'get_related_licences') else [];\r\n    related_licences python:[self.get_related_licences(licence_types=['BuildLicence', 'CODT_BuildLicence'], decision_limit_date='1907/01/02', licence_state='accepted', with_historic=True)] if hasattr(self, 'get_related_licences') else [];\r\n \r\n\r\n    impactStudy python: licence.impactStudy;\r\n    notImpactStudy python: not licence.impactStudy;\r\n\r\n\r\nsi_gru python: len(self.regional_guide) > 0;  \r\nsi_sdc python: len(self.SDC) > 0;\r\n\r\nsi_zonecaptage python: len(self.catchmentArea) > 0;\r\nzone python: licence.catchmentArea;\r\ngru python: licence.regional_guide;\r\n    sdc_zone python: licence.SDC;\r\n\r\n    si_patrimoine1ha python: len(self.patrimony_project_gtoret_1ha) > 0;\r\n    patrimoine python: 'certificat de patrimoine' in licence.protectedBuilding;\r\n    has_protected_building python: len(self.protectedBuilding) > 0; \r\n    protected_building python: self.protectedBuilding; \r\n    is_archeologique python: 'archeologique' in self.getProtectedBuilding(); \r\n    is_centre_ancien_protege python: 'centre-ancien-protege' in self.getProtectedBuilding(); \r\n    is_classe python: 'classe' in self.getProtectedBuilding(); \r\n    is_zoneprotection python: 'zoneprotection' in self.getProtectedBuilding(); \r\n    is_cpdelivre python: 'certificatpatrimoine' in self.getProtectedBuilding();\r\n    is_inventaire python: 'reprisinventaire' in self.getProtectedBuilding();\r\n    \r\n    egout python: licence.sewers;\r\n  \r\n    has_pash python: len(self.pash) > 0;\r\n    zone_pash python: self.pash;\r\n    bassinhydaulique python: context.pashDetails;\r\n    is_in_natura_2000 self/natura_2000;\r\n    is_in_sevesoSite self/sevesoSite;\r\n    has_linked_inquiry python: bool(context.getLastInquiry() and self.getLastInquiry().getLinkedInquiry());\r\n    folder_zone self/folderZone;\r\n    is_in_pca self/isInPCA;\r\n    pca_zone self/pcaZone;\r\n    is_in_subdivision self/isInSubdivision;\r\n    subdivision_details python: context.subdivisionDetails;\r\n    has_catchment_area_and_not_outside python: len(self.catchmentArea) > 0 and 'outside' not in context.catchmentArea;\r\n    date_de_delivrance_du_lot python: self.getParcellings() and self.get_parcellings().split(' - ')[1][:-1];\r\n    numero_de_lot python: self.getParcellings() and self.get_parcellings().split(' (')[0]; \r\n    licence_view python: self.restrictedTraverse('document_generation_helper_view');\r\n    noteworthyTrees python: licence.noteworthyTrees;\r\n    notNoteworthyTrees python: not licence.noteworthyTrees;\r\n    remarquable python: licence.noteworthyTrees ;\r\n\r\n    categorieEau python: self.watercourseCategories;\r\n    karstNone python: 'no' in licence.karstConstraints;\r\n    karstFaible python: 'low' in licence.karstConstraints;\r\n    karstMod python: 'moderate' in licence.karstConstraints;\r\n    karstFort python: 'high' in licence.karstConstraints;\r\n    karstAll python: licence.karstConstraints;\r\n    floodingLevelRisque python: licence.floodingLevel;\r\n    floodingLevelNon python: not licence.floodingLevel;\r\n    concentratedRunoffSRiskAll python: licence.concentratedRunoffSRisk;\r\n    notConcentratedRunoffSRisk python: not licence.concentratedRunoffSRisk;\r\n    sevesoSite python: licence.sevesoSite;    \r\n    pash python: licence.pash;\r\n    trailDetails python: licence_view.display_html_as_text(html=self.getTrailDetails());\r\n  \r\n    has_voirie python: len(self.roadAdaptation) > 0;\r\n    is_modification python:'modify' in self.getRoadAdaptation();\r\n    is_ouverture python:'create' in self.getRoadAdaptation();\r\n    is_suppression python:'supress' in self.getRoadAdaptation();\r\n\r\n    has_derogation python: len(self.derogation) > 0; \r\n    derogation python: self.derogation; \r\n    detail_derogation python: self.getDerogationDetails(); \r\n    is_enquete_public python:'inquiry' in self.getProcedureChoice(); \r\n    nombre_de_reclamationEP python: self.getLastInquiry() and len(self.getLastInquiry().getClaimants()) or 0;\r\n    article_enquete python: self.getInvestigationArticlesText();\r\n    date_debutenquete python: self.getLastInquiry() and (self.getLastInquiry().investigationStart);\r\n    date_finenquete python: self.getLastInquiry() and (self.getLastInquiry().investigationEnd);\r\n\r\n\r\n    all_opinion_requests_no_dup python: self.getAllOpinionRequestsNoDup(); \r\n    has_all_opinion_requests_no_dup python: len(self.getAllOpinionRequestsNoDup()) > 0; \r\n    avis_obligatoire python: self.solicitOpinionsTo;\r\n    avis_facultatif python: self.solicitOpinionsToOptional; \r\n\r\n \r\n    has_procedureChoise python: len(self.procedureChoice) > 0; \r\n  \r\n    analysRoad python: licence.roadAnalysis;\r\n\r\n    hasModifiedBlueprints python: licence.hasModifiedBlueprints;\r\n    date_de_transmis_nouveau_complet python: licence.getLastModificationDeposit() and tool.formatDate(licence.getLastModificationDeposit().getEventDate());\r\n \r\n    is_in_prorogation self/prorogation; \r\n    proro python: self.getProrogationDelay();\r\n\r\n    \r\n    location_technical_advice context/locationTechnicalAdvice;\r\n\r\n    lastCollegeReport python: self.getLastCollegeReport();\r\n    date_decision python: tool.formatDate(licence.getLastTheLicence().getDecisionDate()); \r\n\r\n\" > \r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Vu le Code du D\u00e9veloppement Territorial (ci-apr\u00e8s, le Code) ;</p> \r\n\r\n<p>Vu le Livre Ier du Code de l'environnement ;</p> \r\n\r\n<p>Vu l'article 1123-23, 1\u00b0 du Code de la D\u00e9mocratie locale et de la D\u00e9centralisation ;</p> \r\n\r\n<p tal:condition=\"si_1dem\">Consid\u00e9rant que <tal:a replace=\"applicants_signaletic\"/> a introduit une demande de certificat d'urbanisme relative \u00e0 un bien sis <tal:a replace=\"work_location_signaletic\"/>, cadastr\u00e9 <tal:a replace=\"portion_outs_text\"/>, et ayant pour objet : <tal:a replace=\"python: self.getLicenceSubject()[0].lower() + self.getLicenceSubject()[1:]\"/> ;</p> \r\n<p tal:condition=\"python:\"si_demandeurs\">Consid\u00e9rant que <tal:a replace=\"applicants_signaletic\"/> ont introduit une demande de certificat d'urbanisme relative \u00e0 un bien sis <tal:a replace=\"work_location_signaletic\"/>, cadastr\u00e9 <tal:a replace=\"portion_outs_text\"/>, et ayant pour objet : <tal:a replace=\"python: self.getLicenceSubject()[0].lower() + self.getLicenceSubject()[1:]\"/> ;</p> \r\n\r\n<p tal:condition=\"python: bool(lastMissingPart)\">Consid\u00e9rant qu'un relev\u00e9 des pi\u00e8ces manquantes a \u00e9t\u00e9 envoy\u00e9 au demandeur en date du <tal:fusion replace=\"date_incomplet\"/> ; </p>\r\n<p tal:condition=\"python: bool(lastMissingPartDeposit)\">Consid\u00e9rant que le demandeur a compl\u00e9t\u00e9 son dossier le <tal:fusion replace=\"date_complement\"/>; </p>\r\n<p tal:condition=\"python: lastDefaultAcknowledgment\">Consid\u00e9rant qu\u2019\u00e0 d\u00e9faut de l\u2019envoi de l\u2019accus\u00e9 de r\u00e9ception vis\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019article D.IV.33 du Code, la demande est consid\u00e9r\u00e9e comme recevable ;</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p tal:condition=\"python: not lastDefaultAcknowledgment\">Consid\u00e9rant que la demande compl\u00e8te a fait l'objet, en application de l'article D.IV.33 du Code, d'un accus\u00e9 de r\u00e9ception envoy\u00e9 en date du <tal:a replace=\"date_accuse_de_reception\"/>;</p> \r\n\r\n\r\n<p tal:condition=\"is_in_prorogation\">Consid\u00e9rant que le d\u00e9lai de d\u00e9cision imparti au Coll\u00e8ge communal pour statuer sur la pr\u00e9sente demande a \u00e9t\u00e9 prorog\u00e9 de <tal:a replace=\"proro\"/>, conform\u00e9ment \u00e0 l'article D.IV.46 du Code ;</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Consid\u00e9rant que le permis n'a pu \u00eatre notifi\u00e9 \u00e0 temps au demandeur ;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Que d\u00e8s lors, la d\u00e9cision d'octroi de permis d'urbanisme du <tal:a replace=\"date_decision\"/> pour <tal:a replace=\"applicants_signaletic\"/> est devenue nulle et non avenue ;</p>\r\n\r\n</tal:vars>"
            },
            {
                "fieldname": "pmDecision",
                "text": "<tal:vars define=\"\r\napplicantobj python: self.getApplicants()[0];\r\napplicants_signaletic python: self.getApplicantsSignaletic();\r\nwork_location_signaletic python: self.getWorkLocationSignaletic();\r\nportion_outs_text python: self.getPortionOutsText();\r\nlicence_subject python: self.getLicenceSubject();\r\naccuse_de_reception_complet python: self.getLastAcknowledgment();\r\n\" >\r\nDECIDE\r\n\r\n- de transmettre informellement le dossier au Fonctionnaire D\u00e9l\u00e9gu\u00e9 qui est saisi de la demande.\r\n\r\n- d'annuler la facture ou de rembourser le demandeur du montant per\u00e7u au titre de frais de dossier; \u00e0 savoir XXX\u20ac; conform\u00e9ment \u00e0 l'article D.IV.47 \u00a74.\r\n</tal:vars>"
            }
